Trans:
**⚡️The Ukrainian Orthodox Church of the Moscow Patriarchate (UOC-MP) is facing full-scale action**

In his evening address, Zelensky stated that:
▪️The National Security and Defense Council will **submit a bill prohibiting religious organizations affiliated with centers of influence in the Russian Federation from operating in Ukraine**;
▪️A religious studies expert review of the UOC-MP's charter will be conducted to check for canonical ties to the Moscow Patriarchate;
▪️An investigation will be carried out regarding the **use of property located within the National Kyiv-Mohyla Historical-Cultural Reserve**;
▪️Measures will be intensified to identify and counteract subversive activities by Russian intelligence services in Ukraine's religious sphere. **Personal sanctions will also be applied—names will be made public soon.**

