Among the tips:
- Turn off all electrical appliances to prevent fires from voltage surges;
- Seal windows and doors tightly, and additionally insulate the entrance door to retain warmth;
- Gather all family members in one room and temporarily close others;
- Find out about nearby heating points, water collection points, and mobile phone charging stations.

